  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: M12
  Title: 'Snapping: Per Step'
  Summary: PER STEP lets each step choose; a step whose own box is ticked always
    snaps.
  Watch: Per Step On, Per Step Off, Own Box Ticked
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 345630453}
  - {fileID: 38789242}
  - {fileID: 1665244365}
  HowTo: Zoom in on the heroes. Play <b>Per Step</b>, then <b>Disabled But Ticked</b>.
    Open both animations' steps.
  Expect: In Per Step, the top hero steps a pixel at a time while the middle one
    glides. Disabled But Ticked steps too, though its Snapping button reads DISABLED.
    Every step of Per Step shows a Snapping box; Disabled But Ticked's step still
    shows its ticked box.
  Needs: 5
  Style: 0
  WikiPage: 
  Capture: 
  Width: 620
  StageHeight: 260
  Header: {fileID: 325747345}
  Stage: {fileID: 2012025921}
  Footer: {fileID: 911189381}
