  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::UIAnimLab.Station
  Code: M10
  Title: 'Custom FPS: staggers, punches, Set Active'
  Summary: 'At 4 FPS: two moves staggered by 0.07 s, a punch, and a Set Active at
    0.33 s.'
  Watch: A, B, Punch, Lamp
  WatchObjects:
  - {fileID: 1586210503}
  - {fileID: 39896026}
  - {fileID: 6782951}
  - {fileID: 2004097882}
  HowTo: Play <b>Mixed</b>. Stop and Restore afterwards.
  Expect: A and B jump forward on the same ticks (one shared frame grid), not alternately.
    The punch wobbles smoothly - punch and shake are never stepped. The star appears
    at its own moment, between ticks, not on the nearest one.
  Needs: 1
  Style: 0
